s, or text boxes to add your thoughts. Format your text using a bulleted or numbered list, then use the marker or highlighter to draw attention to important information."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam's"," ",(0,n.jsx)(t7.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/meeting-notes-template/",children:"meeting notes template"})," ","is a great starting point for jotting down important takeaways and organizing your notes."," "]})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("details",{className:rr,children:[(0,n.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("span",{className:rn,id:"7-can-i-use-the-online-whiteboard-for-personal-projects",children:"Can I use the online whiteboard for personal projects?"})," ",(0,n.jsx)(t9.k,{className:ri})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["Yes! FigJam is a free tool to use for personal, professional, or educational projects. Since the online whiteboard is so versatile, it's easy to use for various personal projects or tasks like organizing weekly tasks, studying for exams, setting goals, or journaling your thoughts."," "]})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("details",{className:rr,children:[(0,n.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("span",{className:rn,id:"8-can-i-use-figjam-digital-whiteboards-with-conferencing-platforms",children:"Can I use FigJam digital whiteboards with conferencing platforms?"})," ",(0,n.jsx)(t9.k,{className:ri})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam integrates with many popular conferencing platforms to make it easy to present your whiteboard without leaving your conferencing tool. Learn more about how to integrate FigJam with the following platforms:"," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)(t7.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/17720082601751-Figma-and-Zoom",children:"FigJam and Zoom"})," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)(t7.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/16921722048151-Figma-and-Google-Meet",children:"FigJam and Google Meet"})," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)(t7.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/ar